        <h3>Point the agent only at the files that matter</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 23px; color: var(--fg-muted); margin-bottom: 14px;"><strong>Objective:</strong> scope the session-timeout task to the smallest set of files with real signal, then compare the token cost to your Lab 0 baseline.</p>
        <ol>
          <li>Identify the 1 or 2 files in <code>token-efficient-workshop-node</code> that own session timeout (hint: <code>session.config.ts</code>).</li>
