          <li>Record input tokens, output tokens, and total cost. Compare against your Lab 0 baseline.</li>
        </ol>
        <p class="lab-out"><strong>Expected result:</strong> fewer input tokens than the baseline, the correct fix applied, and a faster response. The agent reads less, hallucinates less.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="callout">
        Scoping is not about hiding information. It is about giving the model the right information at the right moment.
